{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the adrenaline-pumping realm of multiplayer shooter gaming! In this sci-fi setting, choose from three unique kits - the Hornet, the Hound, and the Heavy - each with their own movement speeds and characteristics to master and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players spawn with a primary and a secondary weapon, and you cannot pick up someone else's, so build your loadout wisely. Restore armor by picking up drops from fallen enemies and choose from a range of tactical and passive abilities, including Stalker, Deployable Cover, Armor Leech, and Predator, to add an extra layer of strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a casual or competitive player, get ready to suit up and engage in a battle like no other in this indie game that offers a thrilling gaming experience.<br><br>Control the Chaos: Master the Mayhem!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kill Stolen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2370990/56fe908a5b5a42f193538bf3efa60173a73bc9c5.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2370990/b162532f4c2fcfb784073d840462b78f9d4ee542.jpg"},{"name":"Just Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2370990/44ddc5216365f63957f2285a5ca9647429ac0246.jpg"},{"name":"Mayhemic!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2370990/b455c73ba145cf91b4e7176bf6dd6028ac33c95c.jpg"},{"name":"Milhemic!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2370990/cdeb8f0585fd9a4b5179302e4aeba6936346619b.jpg"},{"name":"Kills Stolen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2370990/56fe908a5b5a42f193538bf3efa60173a73bc9c5.jpg"},{"name":"Can't Get These Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam